  "fairness_notes": "All operators share tmo_pipeline.produce_ldr + compute_scores (TMQI, FSITM, TMQI-II). The reference is the ORIGINAL linear HDR (capped identically for all), center-cropped for CATMO (which crops its input to multiples of 32 px) and resized for any other size change. lhdr operators whose luminance-hdr output is linear display luminance get --postgamma 2.2 (lhdr_postgamma); durand, mantiuk06, mantiuk08 and mai are already display-encoded and keep the CLI default of 1. vanhateren also keeps 1, but its pixel encoding is unresolved: it shares the other lhdr operators' PNG container (no gAMA/sRGB/iCCP chunk, one PngWriter), which says nothing about the transfer curve of its pixel values. See experiments/reinhard_check/FINDINGS.md."
